                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 806.0, 412.0, 440.0, 60.0 ],
                    "text": "dsp: node sends `dsp apply <driver> <sr> <vs> <settleMs>` before ready and `dsp restore` after the teardowns; the script drives the adstatus objects (left outlets straight to its inlets 1-4: a prepend there would obey their `set`) and answers dspReady / dspRestored"
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "id": "obj-72",
                    "linecount": 3,
                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 385.0, 602.0, 240.0, 47.0 ],
                    "text": "teardown: every [mUnit.teardown] fires; node waits for their teardownDone (up to teardownMs) before finished / idle / quit"
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "id": "obj-32",
                    "linecount": 3,
                    "maxclass": "message",
