                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 249.0, 314.0, 191.0, 181.0 ],
                    "text": "node sends `ready 1` once configured (`ready 0` on reset). It only counts once [p preloadCapture] has replayed its buffer, so every assert queued before node started is registered before any test runs. Latch it in [value munit.ready] BEFORE sending, so [mUnit.loadbang] in patches opened later still fires. It also sends `start` to node first, which opens the settle window for finishing the suite"
                }
            },
